### Create a campaign with the default collection window
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/campaigns
Authorization: Basic {{adminUsername}} {{adminPassword}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"code":"MANUAL_{{$timestamp}}","capacity":5}

> {% client.global.set("campaignId", response.body.id); %}

### Submit a claim
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/claims
Content-Type: application/json

{"campaignId":"{{campaignId}}","userId":"manual-user"}

> {% client.global.set("requestId", response.body.requestId); %}

### Poll the claim after the collection window closes
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/claims/{{requestId}}

### Inspect inventory
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/campaigns/{{campaignId}}
Authorization: Basic {{adminUsername}} {{adminPassword}}
